243	2608.27366	Stageboost: Recommending Signals Based on Counterfactual Estimation	Signals are short textual or visual snippets displayed on the eBay View-Item (VI) page, providing additional, contextual information for users about the viewed item. The aim of displaying these signals is to facilitate intelligent purchase and to incentivize engagement. In this paper, we present a 2 stage xgboost based model that optimally populates the VI page with signals. This approach has shown a 0.08% lift in overall GMB (Gross Merchandise Bought) and 0.58% increase in Parts and Accessories GMB, primarily due to increase in conversion of high average price items in online experimentation.	2026-08-27 17:04:45+00	2026-08-27 17:04:45+00	https://arxiv.org/pdf/2608.27366v1	{cs.IR,cs.AI}	https://openalex.org/W7204562168	\N	0	2	1.431	EMBEDDED	{"arxiv_id_versioned": "2608.27366v1", "authors_raw": ["Darpan Singhal", "Matan Mandelbrod", "Tal Franji", "Manasa Kolla", "Vipul Gaba", "Yuri Brovman"], "primary_category": "cs.IR", "comment": "Accepted for Consequences 2026 workshop", "doi": null, "openalex": {"openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/W7204562168", "cited_by_count": 0, "referenced_works_count": 0, "publication_year": 2026, "type": "preprint", "authorships": [{"name": "Darpan Singhal", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5127839702", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Matan Mandelbrod", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5119842856", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Tal Franji", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5119556654", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Manasa Kolla", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5000852278", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Vipul Gaba", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5148474059", "affiliation": null}, {"name": "Yuri Brovman", "openalex_id": "https://openalex.org/A5148493896", "affiliation": null}], "concepts": [{"name": "Counterfactual thinking", "score": 0.8041999936103821}, {"name": "Computer science", "score": 0.6654999852180481}, {"name": "L